diff --git a/.claude/agents/lessons/audit-verifier.md b/.claude/agents/lessons/audit-verifier.md
index 770f28bb..e25579f2 100644
--- a/.claude/agents/lessons/audit-verifier.md
+++ b/.claude/agents/lessons/audit-verifier.md
@@ -5,3 +5,4 @@
 - (2026-10-03, #19) A verifier's own counts need measuring too: the previous verification wrote "22 drafts" and "code 1-11 (9 drafts)" from memory of the manifest; counting the files and the `title:` lines gave 23 drafts. Count with a command before writing a number. (Count drafts, findings and lines with a command before writing any number in the verdict.)
 - (2026-10-03, #21) An empty-diff issue ("created in error", delivered under a successor) went through all stages cleanly. The verifier can finish by re-running the successor's filtered unit, guard and contract tests and comparing the per-file union of hits to tests.md, which takes about 3 minutes once built. (For an empty-diff audit, re-run the tests stage's filtered runs and compare per-file figures; that is enough to verify it.)
 - (2026-10-03, #22) Both corrections from the previous FAIL (a draft built from a "- none" Findings section plus trailing prose, and a duration written from memory) were fixed by re-running only the named stages. The re-verification could stay narrow: recompute the duration from the timestamps, list the draft directory in both the worktree and the main checkout, and count the numbered findings with a command. (After a FAIL, re-verify narrowly: recompute figures from their source, list the draft directory in the worktree and the main checkout, count numbered findings with a command.)
+- (2026-10-03, #25) For an empty-diff closed-in-error audit, the whole filtered run (unit, guard, contract, integration with Docker) takes about 3 minutes in total once built. Re-running it and parsing cobertura by leaf file name reproduced tests.md exactly. Key the union by file leaf name plus line number, because a path-keyed union double-counts files that appear under different class paths. (When re-computing coverage unions from several cobertura files, key lines by file leaf name plus line number; a full-path key double-counts files that appear under different class paths.)
diff --git a/.claude/agents/lessons/docs-reviewer.md b/.claude/agents/lessons/docs-reviewer.md
index d4cd792c..60348f43 100644
--- a/.claude/agents/lessons/docs-reviewer.md
+++ b/.claude/agents/lessons/docs-reviewer.md
@@ -21,3 +21,4 @@
 - (2026-10-03, #21) When the code stage ends on an empty diff (issue closed in error, delivery under a successor), the docs stage can end with one search for the proposed-but-absent identifiers across all `*.md` files, plus a check that no page documents them. It does not need to review the successor's pages. (For a closed-in-error issue with an empty diff, search all *.md for the proposed-but-absent identifiers and stop; the successor's pages belong to its own audit.)
 - (2026-10-03, #21) Docs stage: it said `cursor-pagination.md`, `crypto-shredding.md` and `audit-marten.md` "only mention the word" projection. `data-retention.md` also does. This did not change any outcome. Docs stages should list matches from the search output, not from memory. (List search matches from the command output, never from memory.)
 - (2026-10-03, #23) The docs stage cites `EncinaFixture.cs:37`; the class declaration is at `src/Encina.Testing/EncinaFixture.cs:42` (docs stage wrong by five lines; the draft uses :42). (Read every cited line (and the file's line count) before writing a file:line citation (audit #23 FAIL: ROADMAP.md:3102 in an 841-line file, EncinaFixture.cs:37 for :42).)
+- (2026-10-03, #26) The `artifacts/` tree is ignored by ripgrep, so Grep never sees the audit's own artifacts; docs-stage claims about hits inside `artifacts/` must be verified with `Select-String`, and a docs stage that counts "N files" should say whether its own artifact is included. (In audit mode, search with `Select-String` (PowerShell) when a claim covers `artifacts/`, because Grep/ripgrep ignores that tree; when counting matching files, say whether the audit's own artifacts are included.)
diff --git a/.claude/agents/lessons/issue-archivist.md b/.claude/agents/lessons/issue-archivist.md
index 79d0bb7e..81f96d84 100644
--- a/.claude/agents/lessons/issue-archivist.md
